<title>JAPAN: Nishio Rent plans 1.1-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>Nishio Rent plans 1.1-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nishio Rent All Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on November 15, for shareholders as of September 30.</p>
</text>
